sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Ağ Admini
    participant API as nabs-core-api
    participant R as Redis
    participant W as celery-worker
    participant D as Ağ Cihazı
    participant S as sanitizer
    participant G as Git Repo
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over U,DB: Aktif yedekleme (SSH)
    U->>API: POST /assets/{id}/backup
    API->>DB: BackupHistory(status=QUEUED)
    API->>R: run_active_backup.delay(history_id)
    API-->>U: 202 queued (job_id)
    R->>W: görev teslim
    W->>DB: status=IN_PROGRESS
    W->>D: SSH (Scrapli) — read-only "show run"
    D-->>W: config metni
    W->>S: sanitize (parolalar maskelenir)
    S-->>W: temiz config
    W->>G: değiştiyse commit (diff)
    W->>DB: status=SUCCESS + commit_hash
    W->>R: run_security_analysis.delay
    Note over W,DB: statik + politika taraması → advisories → risk skoru → drift → bildirim

    Note over D,API: Pasif yedekleme (air-gapped)
    D->>API: SFTP push → SFTPGo webhook (HMAC imzalı)
    API->>API: imza doğrula + path-traversal kontrol
    API->>S: sanitize
    API->>G: commit
    API->>R: run_security_analysis.delay
